{"slug": "snake", "name": "스네이크", "keywords": ["스네이크", "뱀 게임", "뱀", "snake"], "prompt": "클래식 스네이크 게임을 만들어줘. 먹이를 먹으면 길어지고 속도가 조금씩 빨라진다. 벽/자기 몸에 부딪히면 게임오버, 점수와 최고점, 재시작. 그리드 기반 깔끔한 스타일.", "description": "클래식 스네이크 게임을 만들었어요. 그리드 기반 이동, 먹이 섭취 시 성장 및 점진적 가속, 벽/자기 몸 충돌 시 게임오버, 로컬스토리지 최고점 저장, 재시작 기능을 포함했고, PC 키보드와 모바일 터치 방향버튼을 모두 지원하며 화면 크기에 맞춰 반응형으로 스케일링됩니다.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><script>try{window.localStorage.getItem('__t')}catch(e){(function(){var m={};var s={getItem:function(k){return k in m?m[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){m[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete m[k]},clear:function(){m={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(m)[i]||null},get length(){return Object.keys(m).length}};try{Object.defineProperty(window,'localStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}try{Object.defineProperty(window,'sessionStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}})()}</script>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n<title>클래식 스네이크</title>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    background: #000; overflow: hidden;\n    touch-action: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\n    font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;\n  }\n  #wrap {\n    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  }\n  canvas {\n    background: #0a0a0a;\n    image-rendering: pixelated;\n    touch-action: none;\n  }\n  #hud {\n    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    color: #7CFC7C;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,255,0,0.5);\n  }\n  #overlay {\n    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);\n    color: #fff; text-align: center;\n  }\n  #overlay h1 {\n    color: #4CFF4C;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(76,255,76,0.8);\n  }\n  #overlay p { margin: 4px 0; color: #ccc; }\n  #restartBtn {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    padding: 12px 28px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    background: #1a3a1a;\n    color: #7CFC7C;\n    border: 2px solid #4CFF4C;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  #touchControls {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;\n    display: none;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 14px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .padGroup {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 170px; height: 170px;\n    pointer-events: auto;\n  }\n  .padBtn {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 56px; height: 56px;\n    background: rgba(76,255,76,0.15);\n    border: 2px solid rgba(124,252,124,0.6);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    color: #7CFC7C;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  .padBtn:active { background: rgba(76,255,76,0.4); }\n  #btnUp    { top: 0; left: 57px; }\n  #btnDown  { bottom: 0; left: 57px; }\n  #btnLeft  { top: 57px; left: 0; }\n  #btnRight { top: 57px; right: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"wrap\">\n  <canvas id=\"game\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<div id=\"hud\">\n  <div id=\"scoreDisp\">점수: 0</div>\n  <div id=\"highDisp\">최고점: 0</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"overlay\">\n  <h1>게임 오버</h1>\n  <p id=\"finalScore\">점수: 0</p>\n  <p id=\"finalHigh\">최고점: 0</p>\n  <button id=\"restartBtn\">다시 시작 (Space)</button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"touchControls\">\n  <div class=\"padGroup\">\n    <div class=\"padBtn\" id=\"btnUp\">▲</div>\n    <div class=\"padBtn\" id=\"btnDown\">▼</div>\n    <div class=\"padBtn\" id=\"btnLeft\">◀</div>\n    <div class=\"padBtn\" id=\"btnRight\">▶</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"width:170px;\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('game');\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  const wrap = document.getElementById('wrap');\n  const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');\n  const scoreDisp = document.getElementById('scoreDisp');\n  const highDisp = document.getElementById('highDisp');\n  const finalScore = document.getElementById('finalScore');\n  const finalHigh = document.getElementById('finalHigh');\n  const restartBtn = document.getElementById('restartBtn');\n  const touchControls = document.getElementById('touchControls');\n\n  const COLS = 20, ROWS = 20;\n  let cellSize = 20;\n\n  // ---- Responsive sizing ----\n  function resize(){\n    const availW = window.innerWidth;\n    const availH = window.innerHeight;\n    const margin = 40;\n    const size = Math.max(200, Math.min(availW - margin, availH - margin - 60));\n    cellSize = Math.floor(size / COLS);\n    if (cellSize < 8) cellSize = 8;\n    canvas.width = cellSize * COLS;\n    canvas.height = cellSize * ROWS;\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  resize();\n\n  // ---- Touch detection ----\n  const isTouch = ('ontouchstart' in window) || navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0;\n  if (isTouch) {\n    touchControls.style.display = 'flex';\n  }\n\n  // ---- Game state ----\n  let snake, dir, nextDir, food, score, highScore, gameOver, moveInterval, accumTime, lastTime, running;\n\n  highScore = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('snakeHighScore') || '0', 10);\n  highDisp.textContent = '최고점: ' + highScore;\n\n  function resetGame(){\n    const startX = Math.floor(COLS/2);\n    const startY = Math.floor(ROWS/2);\n    snake = [\n      {x: startX, y: startY},\n      {x: startX-1, y: startY},\n      {x: startX-2, y: startY}\n    ];\n    dir = {x:1, y:0};\n    nextDir = {x:1, y:0};\n    score = 0;\n    moveInterval = 150;\n    accumTime = 0;\n    lastTime = 0;\n    gameOver = false;\n    running = true;\n    placeFood();\n    overlay.style.display = 'none';\n    scoreDisp.textContent = '점수: 0';\n  }\n\n  function placeFood(){\n    let valid = false;\n    while(!valid){\n      food = {\n        x: Math.floor(Math.random()*COLS),\n        y: Math.floor(Math.random()*ROWS)\n      };\n      valid = !snake.some(s => s.x === food.x && s.y === food.y);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function setDirection(nx, ny){\n    // prevent reversing directly into itself\n    if (snake.length > 1 && nx === -dir.x && ny === -dir.y) return;\n    nextDir = {x: nx, y: ny};\n  }\n\n  // ---- Keyboard ----\n  window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    switch(e.key){\n      case 'ArrowUp': case 'w': case 'W':\n        setDirection(0,-1); e.preventDefault(); break;\n      case 'ArrowDown': case 's': case 'S':\n        setDirection(0,1); e.preventDefault(); break;\n      case 'ArrowLeft': case 'a': case 'A':\n        setDirection(-1,0); e.preventDefault(); break;\n      case 'ArrowRight': case 'd': case 'D':\n        setDirection(1,0); e.preventDefault(); break;\n      case ' ':\n        if (gameOver) resetGame();\n        e.preventDefault();\n        break;\n    }\n  }, {passive:false});\n\n  // ---- Touch buttons ----\n  function bindPad(id, nx, ny){\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.addEventListener('touchstart', (e)=>{ e.preventDefault(); setDirection(nx,ny); }, {passive:false});\n    el.addEventListener('mousedown', (e)=>{ e.preventDefault(); setDirection(nx,ny); });\n  }\n  bindPad('btnUp', 0,-1);\n  bindPad('btnDown', 0,1);\n  bindPad('btnLeft', -1,0);\n  bindPad('btnRight', 1,0);\n\n  // Swipe support on canvas\n  let touchStartX=0, touchStartY=0;\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', (e)=>{\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const t = e.touches[0];\n    touchStartX = t.clientX; touchStartY = t.clientY;\n  }, {passive:false});\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', (e)=>{ e.preventDefault(); }, {passive:false});\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchend', (e)=>{\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n    const dx = t.clientX - touchStartX;\n    const dy = t.clientY - touchStartY;\n    if (Math.abs(dx) < 20 && Math.abs(dy) < 20) {\n      if (gameOver) resetGame();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(dy)) {\n      setDirection(dx > 0 ? 1 : -1, 0);\n    } else {\n      setDirection(0, dy > 0 ? 1 : -1);\n    }\n  }, {passive:false});\n\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', ()=>{\n    if (gameOver) resetGame();\n  });\n\n  restartBtn.addEventListener('click', resetGame);\n  restartBtn.addEventListener('touchstart', (e)=>{ e.preventDefault(); resetGame(); }, {passive:false});\n\n  // ---- Update ----\n  function update(){\n    dir = nextDir;\n    const head = {x: snake[0].x + dir.x, y: snake[0].y + dir.y};\n\n    // wall collision\n    if (head.x < 0 || head.x >= COLS || head.y < 0 || head.y >= ROWS) {\n      endGame();\n      return;\n    }\n    // self collision\n    if (snake.some(s => s.x === head.x && s.y === head.y)) {\n      endGame();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    snake.unshift(head);\n\n    if (head.x === food.x && head.y === food.y) {\n      score++;\n      scoreDisp.textContent = '점수: ' + score;\n      moveInterval = Math.max(50, moveInterval - 4);\n      placeFood();\n    } else {\n      snake.pop();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function endGame(){\n    gameOver = true;\n    running = false;\n    if (score > highScore) {\n      highScore = score;\n      localStorage.setItem('snakeHighScore', String(highScore));\n    }\n    highDisp.textContent = '최고점: ' + highScore;\n    finalScore.textContent = '점수: ' + score;\n    finalHigh.textContent = '최고점: ' + highScore;\n    overlay.style.display = 'flex';\n  }\n\n  // ---- Draw ----\n  function draw(){\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#0a0a0a';\n    ctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n    // grid\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    for (let i=0;i<=COLS;i++){\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(i*cellSize, 0);\n      ctx.lineTo(i*cellSize, ROWS*cellSize);\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n    for (let j=0;j<=ROWS;j++){\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(0, j*cellSize);\n      ctx.lineTo(COLS*cellSize, j*cellSize);\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // food\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff4444';\n    const fpad = cellSize*0.15;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(\n      food.x*cellSize + cellSize/2,\n      food.y*cellSize + cellSize/2,\n      (cellSize - fpad*2)/2,\n      0, Math.PI*2\n    );\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.4)';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(\n      food.x*cellSize + cellSize/2 - cellSize*0.12,\n      food.y*cellSize + cellSize/2 - cellSize*0.12,\n      cellSize*0.1, 0, Math.PI*2\n    );\n    ctx.fill();\n\n    // snake\n    for (let i=0;i<snake.length;i++){\n      const s = snake[i];\n      const pad = 1;\n      if (i === 0) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#7CFC7C';\n      } else {\n        const t = i/snake.length;\n        const g = Math.floor(200 - t*100);\n        ctx.fillStyle = `rgb(30, ${g}, 60)`;\n      }\n      ctx.fillRect(s.x*cellSize+pad, s.y*cellSize+pad, cellSize-pad*2, cellSize-pad*2);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // ---- Main loop ----\n  function loop(ts){\n    if (!lastTime) lastTime = ts;\n    const dt = ts - lastTime;\n    lastTime = ts;\n\n    if (running) {\n      accumTime += dt;\n      if (accumTime >= moveInterval) {\n        accumTime = 0;\n        update();\n      }\n    }\n    draw();\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n\n  resetGame();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"}